  "fit": {
    "currency": "USD",
    "lgd_proxy": {
      "definition": {
        "en": "LGD proxy = gross charge-off amount over the gross approved amount (SBA 7(a) fields GrossChargeOffAmount and GrossApproval, the only exposure field the file carries). It is a proxy, not a workout LGD.",
        "es": "Proxy de LGD = monto bruto castigado sobre el monto bruto aprobado (campos SBA 7(a) GrossChargeOffAmount y GrossApproval, el unico campo de exposicion del archivo). Es un proxy, no una LGD de recuperacion."
      },
      "formula": "GrossChargeOffAmount / GrossApproval",
      "source_field": "GrossChargeOffAmount",
      "exposure_field": "GrossApproval",
      "recovery_cash_flows_available": false,
      "bias_direction": "downward",
      "bias_statement": {
        "en": "The proxy is biased low: the approved amount overstates the exposure at default of an amortising loan, so the denominator is too large. A second effect pushes the other way: the SBA 7(a) public file has no recovery cash flows after charge-off, so the proxy ignores recoveries and costs and overstates the loss net of recoveries; it can also exceed 1 when capitalised interest or fees are charged off. The stated direction is the denominator effect (decision D2).",
        "es": "El proxy tiene sesgo a la baja: el monto aprobado sobreestima la exposicion al incumplimiento de un credito que se amortiza, de modo que el denominador es demasiado grande. Un segundo efecto va en sentido contrario: el archivo publico SBA 7(a) no tiene flujos de recuperacion posteriores al castigo, de modo que el proxy ignora recuperaciones y costos y sobreestima la perdida neta de recuperaciones; tambien puede superar 1 si se castigan intereses capitalizados o comisiones. La direccion declarada es el efecto del denominador (decision D2)."
      }
    },
